#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "O programu Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti je zamišljen kao potpuno rješenje za izradu grafova temeljeno na RRDtool bazi vremenskih nizova (TSDB) i rješenju za grafove. Cilj mu je olakšati posao mrežnom administratoru brigom o svim važnim detaljima potrebnima za stvaranje smislenih grafova."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Informacije o korištenju programa Cacti, podršci i ažuriranjima potražite na službenoj %sCacti web-stranici%s."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Aktivni razvojni programeri"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Razvojni programeri koji rade na programu Cacti, njegovoj arhitekturi, dokumentaciji i budućim izdanjima."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Posebna priznanja"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Suradnici na dokumentaciji, osiguranju kvalitete, pakiranju, forumima i našoj YouTube stranici."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Počasni članovi"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Članovi izvorne Cacti grupe koji su se u međuvremenu posvetili drugim karijerama.  I dalje im želimo sve najbolje."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Zahvale"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Posebna zahvala ide %sTobiju Oetikeru%s, tvorcu programa %sRRDtool%s i vrlo popularnog programa %sMRTG%s."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Korisnici programa Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Posebno svima koji su odvojili vrijeme za izradu izvješća o problemu ili na drugi način pomogli u rješavanju problema vezanih uz Cacti. Također svima koji su pridonijeli podršci programu Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licenca"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti je licenciran pod licencom GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Ovaj je program slobodan softver; možete ga redistribuirati i/ili mijenjati pod uvjetima GNU Opće javne licence kako ju je objavila Free Software Foundation; bilo verzije 2 licence ili (po vašem izboru) bilo koje novije verzije."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ovaj se program distribuira u nadi da će biti koristan, ali BEZ IKAKVOG JAMSTVA; čak i bez podrazumijevanog jamstva TRŽIŠNE VRIJEDNOSTI ili PRIKLADNOSTI ZA ODREĐENU SVRHU. Više pojedinosti potražite u GNU Općoj javnoj licenci."

